#. y1:english="Are you looking for something?\nHuh?\nAh,{PA:10} no.{PA:10} I'm thinking of whether||I should get a tattoo or not...\nTattoo?\nYes...{PA:15}||I heard a rumour about a year ago.\nThey say that a Mama-san at this really||cool bar {PA:10}had a tattoo of a flower.\nCould it be Mizuki?\nYes.{PA:10}||I think that was her name.\n...I would like to get the same tattoo,\nso I can look like her. {PA:10}I'm looking for||the master tattoo artist, Utabori.\n...Do you know him by any chance?\n...You shouldn't.\nHuh?{PA:10}||Why not?\nListen.{PA:10} You aren't supposed to get a tattoo||to copy someone.\n...Here is some friendly advice.||Get a different design,{PA:10} or none at all.\nIs that so...?\nYeah.{PA:20}\nAnyway,{PA:10} pretending to be Mizuki is||dangerous.{PA:10} You shouldn't do it.\n...{PA:20}I see."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0032.BIN:75_0_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0032.BIN::line:75_0_0"
msgid "¿Estás buscando algo?"
