#. y1:english="Ah,{PA:10} you are such a handsome guy!||Are you already working in any bars?\nThe name's Sasaki,{PA:10}||and I work at a bar called \"Blue Moon\".\nWhy don't you come work for us?\nI assure you, you'd be very popular||{MS:0}and would earn a lot of money.\nI refuse.\nOh,{PA:10} that's too bad.{PA:20} If you||change your mind, come talk to me again.\nReally?{PA:10}||You'll come to our bar?\nAlright, then could you pay me||10,000 yen as training expenses?\nYou know, you'd earn 10,000 yen||in no time when you start working.\n\nOh, {PA:10}you don't have enough money!\nYou paid 10,000 yen.\nGood.{PA:10} Oh,{PA:10}||I'm sorry but I'm kind of busy right now.\nSo, I'll contact you on the cell phone later.{PA:10}||Talk to you later."
